# Copy this file to .dev.vars for the portable local Worker.
# SERVER ONLY. Synthetic development identity; not a real account or credential.
# The development sign-in shim uses this exact identity on this computer.
POLIS_OWNER_EMAIL=seedy@sites.test

# Production: configure POLIS_OWNER_EMAIL in Sites runtime settings instead.
# Never commit a real owner email, invitation token, or provider credential.
# DB is a Cloudflare D1 binding, not an environment string or database password.
# No OpenAI API key and no NEXT_PUBLIC_* / VITE_* values are required.
